{"t":"Monk","s":"monk-844a2","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Monk_Artwork_b9bed4.png","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><dl><dd><i>This page is about the vocation. For the creature of the same name, see <a href=\"#/wiki/Monk%20%28Creature%29\">Monk (Creature)</a>.</i></dd></dl>\n<p><br/>\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox2 pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Monk</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n<img alt=\"Monk Artwork\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"160\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Monk_Artwork_b9bed4.png\" width=\"270\"/>\n</figure>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">15.00.249ccc<br/>April 08, 2025<br/>Monk Vocation Update</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Monk Banner\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"54\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Monk_Banner_f3983a.png\" width=\"178\"/><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Monk</b> was the fifth vocation to be added to the game, coming out on the Monk Vocation Update after more than 25 years since the game's release. As masters of unarmed combat, Monks specialize in the use of Fist Fighting Weapons. Also, they are capable of supporting and healing allies while using martial arts and mystical abilities to defeat enemies. They have access to three unique mechanics: \n</p>\n<ul><li>Harmony, which is stored by using Builder Spells, and consumed with Spender Spells in order to deal devastating blows.</li>\n<li>Virtue, granting passive bonuses. Also, whenever Harmony is built or spent, the Monk and the lowest % HP member of the Monk's party are healed via Virtue Healing.</li>\n<li>Serene, the state where a <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Monk</strong> is the most powerful. When the state is activate, it will be indicated with a violet bar or circle close to your character on your game screen</li></ul>\n<p>Regardless of the chosen virtue, Monks also grant the following party bonuses:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Knight: –3% damage received.</li>\n<li>Paladin: +6% auto attack damage.</li>\n<li>Sorcerer: +6% spell and rune damage.</li>\n<li>Druid: +12% healing done.</li></ul>\n<p>Monks benefit from the same bonuses while serene, as long as the respective vocation is present.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Advancement_and_regeneration\">Advancement and regeneration</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Stat_increase_per_level\">Stat increase per level</span></h3>\n<p>After advancing to the next level, every player receives an increase in capacity, maximum hitpoints and maximum mana.\n</p><p><b>Monks</b> gain:\n</p>\n<ul><li>25 oz of capacity</li>\n<li>10 hitpoints</li>\n<li>10 mana</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Regeneration\">Regeneration</span></h3>\n<p>As time passes, every player will regenerate lost hitpoints and mana, as long as they have eaten recently (see the page on Regeneration for more information).\n</p><p><b>Monks</b> regenerate:\n</p>\n<ul><li>1 hitpoint every 7 seconds</li>\n<li>2 mana every 4 seconds</li></ul>\n<p><b>Exalted Monks</b> regenerate:\n</p>\n<ul><li>1 hitpoint every <b>5</b> seconds</li>\n<li>2 mana every 3 seconds</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Promotion\">Promotion</span></h3>\n<p>When a monk reaches level 20, they can purchase a promotion and become an exalted monk with certain benefits.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Instant_Spells\">Instant Spells</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>Words\n</th>\n<th>Prem\n</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">Level\n</th>\n<th>Vocations\n</th>\n<th>Mana\n</th>\n<th>Group\n</th>\n<th>Effect\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\">Swift Jab\n</td>\n<td class=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Swift Jab\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Swift_Jab_ad7ea7.gif\" width=\"38\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">exori infir pug</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">0\n</td>\n<td><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Monks</strong>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">3\n</td>\n<td>Attack\n</td>\n<td>Deals damage to an adjacent enemy.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\">Tiger Clash\n</td>\n<td class=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Tiger Clash\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tiger_Clash_231bba.gif\" width=\"38\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">exori infir nia</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">0\n</td>\n<td><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Monks</strong>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">18\n</td>\n<td>Attack\n</td>\n<td>Spend all Harmony to deal damage to an adjacent enemy.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\">Lesser Mystic Repulse\n</td>\n<td class=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Lesser Mystic Repulse\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lesser_Mystic_Repulse_1b561e.gif\" width=\"38\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">exori infir amp pug</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">6\n</td>\n<td><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Monks</strong>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">30\n</td>\n<td>Attack\n</td>\n<td>A weaker version of Mystic Repulse.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\">Light Healing\n</td>\n<td class=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Light Healing\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Light_Healing_9516c1.gif\" width=\"38\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">exura</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">8\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druids</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerers</a>, <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Monks</strong>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">20\n</td>\n<td>Healing\n</td>\n<td>Restores a small amount of health and cures <a href=\"#/wiki/Slowed\">paralysis</a>.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\">Light\n</td>\n<td class=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Light\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Light_8a2123.gif\" width=\"38\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">utevo lux</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">8\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druids</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a> and <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Monks</strong>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">20\n</td>\n<td>Support\n</td>\n<td>Provides illumination in a 3 tile radius around the caster (area effect). Duration is 6 minutes, 10 seconds.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\">Find Person\n</td>\n<td class=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Find Person\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Find_Person_647aa9.gif\" width=\"38\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">exiva \"name\"</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">8\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druids</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a> and <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Monks</strong>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">20\n</td>\n<td>Support\n</td>\n<td>Tells you which direction a certain player is, relative to you, and a rough idea of the distance.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Rope\">Magic Rope</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Rope\"><img alt=\"Magic Rope\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Magic_Rope_e8e80a.gif\" width=\"38\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">exani tera</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">9\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druids</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a> and <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Monks</strong>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">20\n</td>\n<td>Support\n</td>\n<td>Teleports you up through a hole when you are standing in a Rope Spot.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cure%20Poison\">Cure Poison</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cure%20Poison\"><img alt=\"Cure Poison\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cure_Poison_c64edc.gif\" width=\"38\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">exana pox</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">10\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druids</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a>, and <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Monks</strong>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">30\n</td>\n<td>Healing\n</td>\n<td>Cures the status of being poisoned.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Levitate\">Levitate</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Levitate\"><img alt=\"Levitate\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Levitate_66daa0.gif\" width=\"38\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">exani hur up<br/>exani hur down</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">12\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druids</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a> and <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Monks</strong>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">50\n</td>\n<td>Support\n</td>\n<td>Permits vertical movement via levitation, up or down one level.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Light\">Great Light</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Light\"><img alt=\"Great Light\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Great_Light_7c6052.gif\" width=\"38\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">utevo gran lux</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">13\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druids</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a> and <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Monks</strong>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">60\n</td>\n<td>Support\n</td>\n<td>Provides illumination in a 4 tile radius around the caster (area effect). Duration is 11 minutes, 35 seconds.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\">Double Jab\n</td>\n<td class=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Double Jab\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Double_Jab_98fd64.gif\" width=\"38\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">exori pug</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">14\n</td>\n<td><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Monks</strong>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">30\n</td>\n<td>Attack\n</td>\n<td>Deals damage to an adjacent enemy.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Haste\">Haste</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Haste\"><img alt=\"Haste\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Haste_8187a8.gif\" width=\"38\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">utani hur</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">14\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druids</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a> and <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Monks</strong>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">60\n</td>\n<td>Support\n</td>\n<td>Increases your base Speed by 30% for 30 seconds. Cures <a href=\"#/wiki/Slowed\">paralysis</a>.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\">Greater Tiger Clash\n</td>\n<td class=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Greater Tiger Clash\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Greater_Tiger_Clash_c5fad2.gif\" width=\"38\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">exori nia</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">18\n</td>\n<td><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Monks</strong>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">50\n</td>\n<td>Attack\n</td>\n<td>Spend all Harmony to deal damage to an adjacent enemy.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\">Restore Balance\n</td>\n<td class=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Restore Balance\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Restore_Balance_68a587.gif\" width=\"38\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">exura tio sio \"name\"</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">18\n</td>\n<td><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Monks</strong>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">120\n</td>\n<td>Healing\n</td>\n<td>Heals target ally.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\">Virtue of Harmony\n</td>\n<td class=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Virtue of Harmony\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Virtue_of_Harmony_a44c7c.gif\" width=\"38\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">utori virtu</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">20\n</td>\n<td><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Monks</strong>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">210\n</td>\n<td>Support\n</td>\n<td>Increases the Harmony base bonus by 3%, or 6% if Serene. In addition, whenever a Spender is used while in Virtue of Harmony, it will refund 1 Harmony.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\">Virtue of Justice\n</td>\n<td class=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Virtue of Justice\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Virtue_of_Justice_f4a925.gif\" width