iple jump targets are present. This is an Attack Spell from the Builder Spells category.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\">Spirit Mend\n</td>\n<td class=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Spirit Mend\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spirit_Mend_806ae2.gif\" width=\"38\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">exura gran tio</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">80\n</td>\n<td><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Monks</strong>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">210\n</td>\n<td>Healing\n</td>\n<td>Heals the monk.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\">Greater Flurry of Blows\n</td>\n<td class=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Greater Flurry of Blows\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Greater_Flurry_of_Blows_dba448.gif\" width=\"38\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">exori gran mas pug</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">90\n</td>\n<td><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Monks</strong>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">300\n</td>\n<td>Attack\n</td>\n<td>It generates a combo point and also deals considerable area damage. This is an Attack Spell from the builder category.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\">Forceful Uppercut\n</td>\n<td class=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Forceful Uppercut\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Forceful_Uppercut_452a61.gif\" width=\"38\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">exori gran pug</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">110\n</td>\n<td><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Monks</strong>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">325\n</td>\n<td>A